; personality.xon -- what this bundle IS.

(personality "ash")

; RADON, and the only one of the five that needs it.  ash forks, execs, dup2s
; and opens files; Sys's process and file doors are radon opt-ins, exactly as
; the contract's worked example says of Logo.  Declaring anything lighter would
; mean an unbound symbol at the first pipeline instead of a legible refusal at
; acquisition -- which is the whole argument for this row being a requirement
; rather than a preference.
(dialect rn)

(requires-release "0.5.2")

(entry "run.x")
